      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239753/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread 1 tablespoon chocolate-hazelnut spread onto one side of each of 2 slices cinnamon bread; top each with another bread slice to make 2 sandwiches.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LIC-9ahqmEz95rkaOJuXUexW1a0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-239753-nutella-stuffed-french-toast-VAT-step-02-131b3dd4a10a43f6a8dea32e267db1f5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239753/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together milk, beaten egg, and vanilla in a shallow bowl until smooth. Soak each sandwich in milk mixture until bread is moistened, about 15 seconds per side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O9yF3_UgiiepyNiHbSQMNrj2oGU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-239753-nutella-stuffed-french-toast-VAT-step-03-4aa0833b7e1740b49ce9b4a545eddad6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239753/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coat a nonstick pan with cooking spray and heat over medium-high heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_CDNDFjBWGFwFz90ezcPnfPblLM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-239753-nutella-stuffed-french-toast-VAT-step-04-9846f3bfd60a426fbdb53dc84f499e10.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239753/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook sandwiches in the hot pan until browned on the bottom, about 2 minutes. Flip sandwiches and continue cooking until the other side is browned, about 1 minute more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
